# DENY BY DEFAULT.
#
# This repo exists for one purpose: to give Kili a memory she can read on every
# scheduled run. It is NOT a backup of the Kiki folder.
#
# The Kiki folder holds real client PII (prospect names, emails, deal values, call
# transcripts) and large media. None of that belongs here. So everything is ignored
# and specific paths are added back below. A new file is invisible to git unless
# somebody deliberately allows it, which is the safe direction for a folder like
# this one to fail in.
#
# Before widening this list, ask whether Kili actually needs to read the file, and
# whether it names a client.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# Her knowledge base. The whole point.
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/knowledge/

# Her own definition and her specialists, so she knows her roster.
!/.claude/agents/

# Her entry point.
!/.claude/skills/
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/kili/

# Who she is, and the channel she currently reaches Kiki through.
!/kili/
/kili/*
!/kili/NOTICE.md
!/kili/channels/

# Belt and braces. These must never appear regardless of the rules above.
node_modules/
.venv/
.next/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.sqlite
*.db
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
